<title>USA: Camden, Paragon set special meetings.</title>
<headline>Camden, Paragon set special meetings.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Camden Property Trust and Paragon Group Inc said Friday they have set special shareholder meetings to consider their proposed merger.</p>
<p>The meetings are to be held March 31.</p>
<p>Under the deal, Paragon would become a Camden subsidiary.</p>
